  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest caf\u00e9 you\u2019d reach going toward Glensheen - Historic Congdon Estate, Duluth, MN from Bagley Nature Area viewing platform, Duluth, MN?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-92.08933 46.822185)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-92.051721 46.815157)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-92.08933 46.822185)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-92.08933 46.822185)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
